# Copy to .env.local. Every setting below is optional: the application runs
# with none of them set, which is what `npm run dev` does.
#
# There is no secret here, and there is no place for one. The application has
# no server-side integration and calls no third-party API. If a future change
# ever needs a credential, it belongs in the deployment environment, never in
# a file next to the source.

# Public base URL, used for canonical links, the sitemap, robots.txt and the
# Open Graph images. Falls back to https://criblepolitique.fr.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Domain registered with Plausible, the cookieless analytics used by the site.
# When it is unset, the analytics script is not injected at all.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=criblepolitique.fr
